Apply on ezhilagam-prime (staff APK), not this guest website:
  cd /path/to/ezhilagam-prime
  patch -p0 < tests/prime-17.42-same-day-morning.patch
  node scripts/release.js --bump

Walk-in New Reservation used to refuse every same calendar day unless the
slot was exactly Day Use (12:00–17:00). Same-day 6:00 AM → 5:00 PM is a
valid stay and must not show:
  "Check-out must be after check-in, except for same-day Day Use from 12:00 PM to 5:00 PM."

